#: ../../tools/osf_preprints_tools.rst:32 ba9d4a0582e240b6977f78a7899e3f6f
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search OSF (Open Science Framework) Preprints for "
"research preprints and working papers. OSF Preprints aggregates preprints"
" from multiple providers including OSF, PsyArXiv, and others."
msgstr ""
"**描述**：搜索 OSF（开放科学框架）预印本中的研究预印本和工作论文。OSF 预印本汇集了包括 OSF、PsyArXiv "
"及其他多个提供者的预印本。"

#: ../../tools/osf_preprints_tools.rst:34 dc44a55723844a5986697e333cadc89b
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr "**参数：**"

#: ../../tools/osf_preprints_tools.rst:36 90ad53c981174306bbd4cea552ee36d2
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query for OSF preprints. Use "
"keywords to search across titles and abstracts."
msgstr "``query``（字符串）（必填）用于搜索 OSF 预印本的查询词。使用关键词在标题和摘要中进行搜索。"

#: ../../tools/osf_preprints_tools.rst:39 f446953bffab435ca9a10bb24f926f20
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``max_results`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of results to return."
" Default is 10, maximum is 100."
msgstr "``max_results``（整数）（可选）返回结果的最大数量。默认值为10，最大值为100。"

#: ../../tools/osf_preprints_tools.rst:42 aec6e13a331c44c59c9f657b42197af8
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``provider`` (string) (optional) Optional preprint provider filter (e.g.,"
" 'osf', 'psyarxiv', 'socarxiv'). If not specified, searches all "
"providers."
msgstr ""
"``provider``（字符串）（可选） "
"可选的预印本提供商筛选器（例如，'osf'、'psyarxiv'、'socarxiv'）。若未指定，则搜索所有提供商。"

